§ `Regulation 45ZA -- additional types of trust`

-- the record of regulation 42(2)(b) is the trust's facts.  Record order: express; income in the UK; assets in the UK; liable to the taxes; acquires land now (MAYBE); the date acquired (MAYBE); the last day held (MAYBE); business relationship with a relevant person (MAYBE); a trustee resident
GIVEN express IS A BOOLEAN
      land IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
      acquired IS A MAYBE DATE
      held IS A MAYBE DATE
      relationship IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
      resident IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `reg 42(2)(b) the trust`
`reg 45ZA test trust` MEANS `reg 42(2)(b) the trust` WITH
    `the trust is an express trust` IS express
    `the trust receives income from a source in the United Kingdom` IS FALSE
    `the trust has assets in the United Kingdom` IS FALSE
    `the trust is liable to pay one or more of the taxes referred to in regulation 45(14) on that income or those assets` IS FALSE
    `the trustees acquire an interest in land in the United Kingdom` IS land
    `the date on which the trustees acquired an interest in land in the United Kingdom` IS acquired
    `the last day on which the trustees held that interest` IS held
    `the trustees enter into a business relationship with a relevant person` IS relationship
    `at least one of the trustees is resident in the United Kingdom` IS resident

